<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/53/eng@/~cl_16__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "by substituting for subsection (4) the following subsection: \"(4) In a prosecution for an offence against subsection (3) it is a defence if the defendant establishes that— (a) the purpose or purposes for which he did the act was not, or did not include, the purpose of creating a false or misleading appearance; and (b) he did not act recklessly, whether or not he created a false or misleading appearance, of active trading in securities on a stock market.\"."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/53/eng@> .
