<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/53/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act may be cited as the Securities Industry (Amendment) Act 1997."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/53/eng@> .
