<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/53/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act shall come into force on a date to be appointed by the Minister, by notification in the Gazette, and the Minister may appoint different dates for different provisions of this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/53/eng@> .
