<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/53/eng@/~cl_38> <https://schema.org/name> "Section 100 of the principal Act is amended—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/53/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/53/eng@/~cl_38> <https://schema.org/text> "100."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/53/eng@> .
