<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/53/eng@/~cl_38__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "by substituting for subsection (2B) the following subsection: \"(2B) Where an application for an order under subsection (1) is made by the Commission or any person duly authorised by the Commission, the High Court shall not, as a condition of the grant of the order, require any undertaking as to damages to be given by or on behalf of the Commission.\";"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/53/eng@> .
